.TH batten-census-shell 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-census\-shell \- Count every shell line in the declared manifests, workflows and shell files, as pointers
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten census shell\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Count every shell line in the declared manifests, workflows and shell files, as pointers
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-J\fR, \fB\-\-json\fR
Emit byte\-stable JSON instead of pointer lines
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
